# U2: the app visual baselines at a non-default font scale are produced on
# demand (scripts/app-visual.mjs --mode update --scale 2.0) and inspected, not
# committed: they double the binary weight of the repo and churn on every
# deliberate UI change. The normal-size set IS committed, as the daily guard.
apps/mobile/visual-baselines/phone@*/

